50592_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bfrRod6XvzoQ7kNvwH5m6-j&_nc_oc=AdpsxtZ7lAJI0iZq5MJPVudnua7S3j_RJVj62PoZqTjtupaaM9YUFkRyf0rdu0_lOMA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwyzlktVzhEkDXut3y4ddw3wtg7B5736Xb2F8g4dIP2xQ&oe=69C50EE4"}, "display_name": "Horror Zombies Mixed Reality", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Immerse yourself in the captivating world of \"Horror Zombies Mixed Reality\" and get ready for an unforgettable experience! \n\nTHEY ARE HERE!\nArm with multiple weapons, including knives, your pistol and a trusty crowbar, as you engage in pulse-pounding battles against the undead.\n\nMIXED REALITY\nDive headfirst into the experience with the innovative Mixed Reality mode, leveraging the cutting-edge passthrough technology of the Meta Quest VR headset, as you fend off zombies in YOUR own home. \n\nHIGHLIGHTS\n* A captivating Mixed Reality world for an unforgettable experience.\n* Battle against zombies using multiple weapons.\n* Improve your skills at the tryout.\n* Multiple accessibility options.\n\n-> More content coming soon!", "short_description": "Immerse yourself in the captivating world of \"Horror Zombies Mixed Reality\" and get ready for an unforgettable experience! \nArm with multiple weapons, including knives, your pistol and a trusty crowbar, as you engage in pulse-pounding battles against the undead.\nDive headfirst into the experience with the innovative Mixed Reality mode, leveraging the cutting-edge passthrough technology of the Meta Quest VR headset, as you fend off zombies in YOUR own home."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://forstech.de/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Tom Foerster", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://forstech.de/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"i